  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Enchantment Spell. All hostile animated undead in the area become bound to you. Verata's Aura ends after 120...264...300 seconds. When Verata's Aura ends, you lose your bond with any undead bound to you. (50% failure chance with Death Magic 4 or less.)",
      "zhTW": "犧牲自己最大體力的 33% ，使區域內敵方的不死爪牙都受你控制。芙瑞達的靈氣在 120～300 秒後結束。當芙瑞達的靈氣結束時，所有你控制的不死爪牙與你失去主從的關係。（死亡魔法 4 以下，有 50% 失敗機率）"
    },
